  "evidence": [
    {
      "id": "U01",
      "finding": "47.4.9原生performShooting先发ArrowLoose事件，负数则直接return。NarrowZone已在此前FIFO pop，且调用后无论是否被取消都会清ChargedProjectiles、置STOP、停止使用。",
      "sources": [
        {
          "source": "CrossbowItem",
          "ranges": [
            [
              243,
              263
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "source": "ForgeEventFactory",
          "ranges": [
            [
              664,
              669
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "source": "RepeatingCrossbowItem",
          "ranges": [
            [
              290,
              317
            ]
          ]
        }
      ],
      "limit": "在外部事件取消的条件下，本段没有退回那颗弹药；这是静态条件路径，不宣称目标环境已注册该监听器或实机复现。",
      "credit_added": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "U02",
      "finding": "普通箭由对应ArrowItem.createArrow(level,stack,shooter)构造；烟花构造也传shooter。多重射击按0/-10/+10度转换为弧度后绕up向量旋转；原生这里没有Grapple参考里的角度单位混用。",
      "sources": [
        {
          "source": "CrossbowItem",
          "ranges": [
            [
              194,
              240
            ],
            [
              243,
              263
            ]
          ]
        }
      ],
      "limit": "不是把ArrowItem全部子类NBT实现读完；具体特殊箭效果与所有者kill credit仍依各类实际消费者。",
      "credit_added": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "U03",
      "finding": "每个实际shootProjectile调用单独hurtAndBreak(箭1/烟花3)，再addFreshEntity和声音。三发会有三次耐久调用，而弹仓只pop一颗。",
      "sources": [
        {
          "source": "CrossbowItem",
          "ranges": [
            [
              194,
              223
            ],
            [
              243,
              263
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "source": "RepeatingCrossbowItem",
          "ranges": [
            [
              290,
              305
            ]
          ]
        }
      ],
      "limit": "实际耐久受创造、Unbreaking、断裂等规则影响；addFreshEntity结果在此未检查，不能说每次扣弹必成功生成。",
      "credit_added": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "U04",
      "finding": "正常未取消、未破损ServerPlayer路径，原生onCrossbowShot已awardStat一次，返回后NarrowZone又player.awardStat同物品一次；取消事件时原生提前return，后者仍执行。",
      "sources": [
        {
          "source": "CrossbowItem",
          "ranges": [
            [
              243,
              284
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "source": "RepeatingCrossbowItem",
          "ranges": [
            [
              301,
              317
            ]
          ]
        }
      ],
      "limit": "正常+2、取消+1为所读路径条件结论，不声称实际统计界面已测，也不泛化破损空栈或其他mod重定向。",
      "credit_added": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "U05",
      "finding": "stopUsingItem与releaseUsingItem不是一条回调：前者只调onStopUsing并清字段/使用flag；后者先发Stop事件、可能调releaseUsing，再stop。IForgeItem默认onStopUsing为空。",
      "sources": [
        {
          "source": "LivingEntity",
          "ranges": [
            [
              3046,
              3073
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "source": "IForgeItem",
          "ranges": [
            [
              203,
              212
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "source": "IForgeItemStack",
          "ranges": [
            [
              246,
              256
            ]
          ]
        }
      ],
      "limit": "程序stop不自动调用NarrowZone.releaseUsing，因此不能认为TAG_STOP每发立即被该方法消费。",
      "credit_added": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "U06",
      "finding": "NarrowZone每发设置STOP=true后程序stop；后续手动release若仍看到此标志，会先清STOP并return，略过清mode。耗尽最后一发后函数底部还可能把mode设RELOAD，即使using已经结束。",
      "sources": [
        {
          "source": "RepeatingCrossbowItem",
          "ranges": [
            [
              308,
              343
            ]
          ]
        }
      ],
      "limit": "这是残留NBT状态的静态出口，不等于必出重复发射；下一次use会重新设置mode。本批未改参考或生产逻辑。",
      "credit_added": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "U07",
      "finding": "CrossbowItem.useOnRelease覆写按stack.is(this)判断，所以重复弩子类也为true，不是仅Items.CROSSBOW。使用更新达到零时的自动finish只针对!useOnRelease。",
      "sources": [
        {
          "source": "CrossbowItem",
          "ranges": [
